From 2bcb2af2e542633d795434d8b6a93d1a7ea3a7b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:25:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Support offline play

Run the game server in a Web Worker when the browser is offline (or with ?offline),
connected through a WebSocket-like WorkerSocket. A generated service worker precaches
the app shell (network first, cache fallback) so the game loads without a network.
The disconnected screen offers a 'Play offline' button.

Co-Authored-By: Akshat Bubna <akshatb42@gmail.com>
